        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>准爸爸备忘录</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            background-color: #e0e0e0;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            padding: 20px;\n            font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n        .container {\n            background-color: #fcfcfc;\n            border: 8px solid #3b7d36;\n            width: 100%;\n            max-width: 650px;\n            padding: 40px 30px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 38px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n            color: #111;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n        }\n        .section-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin: 35px 0 20px 0;\n        }\n        .section-header span {\n            color: #d32f2f;\n            font-size: 24px;\n            font-weight: 900;\n            position: relative;\n            display: inline-block;\n            z-index: 1;\n            padding: 0 5px;\n        }\n        .section-header span::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 2px;\n            left: -15px;\n            right: -15px;\n            height: 14px;\n            background-color: #ffca28;\n            z-index: -1;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n        }\n        .list-item {\n            display: flex;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: #222;\n        }\n        .bullet {\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            font-weight: normal;\n        }\n        .content {\n            flex-grow: 1;\n            text-align: justify;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>准爸爸备忘录</h1>\n        \n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <span>孕3月</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■1、</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">孕早期油烟味容易刺激孕吐，所以做饭准爸爸也包了吧。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■2、</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">增大的子宫开始压迫膀胱，出现尿频，总有排不净尿的感觉。提醒孕妈千万不要刻意不喝水或憋尿，免得造成尿路感染。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■3、</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">给孕妈准备妊娠油，缓解妊娠纹的增长，虽然长不长纹主要看体质，但是涂了能减轻点。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■4、</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">如果孕妈肚子上长了妊娠纹，要多沟通安抚她的情绪、赞美她，因为肚子上布满青紫色的纹路，会让妈妈变得很沮丧或不自信。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■5、</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">本月重点产检：孕12周去医院建档(需空腹)，提前查好需要准备什么材料，替孕妈做足准备，带上水和零食（重要产检事项可参考我之前的笔记）</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <span>孕4月</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■1、</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">很多孕妈在孕4个半月就开始感觉到胎动，胎动是了解胎儿在宫内情况的最好方法，记得提醒孕妈多关注胎动情况。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■2、</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">孕4个月开始要补充钙剂和铁剂，钙剂提醒孕妈睡前吃，最好吃带有维D成分的钙剂，更好吸收。铁剂晚上7-8点吃，同时补充维生素C，有利于铁剂的吸收。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■3、</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">孕4个月后孕吐减轻，食欲好转。这时候体重增长变快，提醒孕妈控制体重，少食多餐，少油少盐少糖，多吃粗粮。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■4、</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">抽空陪孕妈散步、孕期瑜伽、聊天，帮助孕妈放松心情。提醒孕妈不要久坐、久躺，预防水肿。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■5、</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">外出坐车时，准爸爸可以给孕妈准备专门的孕妇安全带，这样坐车如果急刹车，不会勒肚子和腿，保护孕妈和胎儿</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■6、</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">本月重点产检：孕16周唐筛或无创，无创会更检测得精确点但小贵(一般无需空腹和憋尿)</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
